L["Show health text turns numbers on the bar on or off. Health format picks percentage, value, both, or value with percentage in brackets. Percentage decimal places, Number format and Show % sign fine-tune the number. Position, Horizontal offset and Vertical offset place it on the health bar.\n\nWhen to show can hide the text at full health or show it only on your target. Color sets the text color, can fade it by health, and can turn it a set color in execute range. The Font settings below change its font, size and outline.\n\nWho the enemy is targeting is set on the Name page under Enemy target name."] = "Show health text turns numbers on the bar on or off. Health format picks percentage, value, both, or value with percentage in brackets. Percentage decimal places, Number format and Show % sign fine-tune the number. Position, Horizontal offset and Vertical offset place it on the health bar.\n\nWhen to show can hide the text at full health or show it only on your target. Color sets the text color, can fade it by health, and can turn it a set color in execute range. The Font settings below change its font, size and outline.\n\nWho the enemy is targeting is set on the Name page under Enemy target name."
