L["Show level puts the enemy's level on the nameplate. Show + for elites and Show r for rares mark elites and rares, and Boss level text sets what bosses show. Color by difficulty colors it like the game does, red for hard and grey for easy, and otherwise it uses the color you pick. When to show hides the level on same-level normal enemies, trivial enemies, or in dungeons and raids. Position, offsets and font are on the page too."] = "Show level puts the enemy's level on the nameplate. Show + for elites and Show r for rares mark elites and rares, and Boss level text sets what bosses show. Color by difficulty colors it like the game does, red for hard and grey for easy, and otherwise it uses the color you pick. When to show hides the level on same-level normal enemies, trivial enemies, or in dungeons and raids. Position, offsets and font are on the page too."
