L["Show names turns names on or off. Text color, Use class colors for player names and Match health bar color set the color. Position puts the name above, below, or in one of the corners inside the bar. Text alignment sets left, center or right. Distance from bar moves the name closer to or farther from the bar.\n\nShorten names shows the full name, the first or last word, or initials. Long names decides what happens when the name is still too wide: leave it or cut it at the end or start. Maximum name width sets where it is cut, and 0 means the width of the nameplate. When to show can limit names to your target or hide them while the enemy casts. Font settings are below.\n\nEnemy target name shows who the enemy is currently targeting, separate from the Cast bar page's cast target. Use class colors colors it by class when available, falling back to the swatch beside it otherwise, with its own position and font."] = "Show names turns names on or off. Text color, Use class colors for player names and Match health bar color set the color. Position puts the name above, below, or in one of the corners inside the bar. Text alignment sets left, center or right. Distance from bar moves the name closer to or farther from the bar.\n\nShorten names shows the full name, the first or last word, or initials. Long names decides what happens when the name is still too wide: leave it or cut it at the end or start. Maximum name width sets where it is cut, and 0 means the width of the nameplate. When to show can limit names to your target or hide them while the enemy casts. Font settings are below.\n\nEnemy target name shows who the enemy is currently targeting, separate from the Cast bar page's cast target. Use class colors colors it by class when available, falling back to the swatch beside it otherwise, with its own position and font."
