L["Shows your own class resource on your target's nameplate: combo points for rogues and druids, holy power, soul shards, chi, arcane charges, essence, or runes for death knights. Classes without one show nothing.\n\nIt is on by default. Show class resource on target turns it off. Hide when empty and Glow at maximum change when and how it shows. Use class color or pick a color, and set the Empty segment color for unfilled segments. Segment width, height and spacing change the segments, and Position, distance and offsets place the row on the nameplate. Runes dim while they recharge. Soul shards fill in tenths, so a partly full shard shows as a partly filled piece."] = "Shows your own class resource on your target's nameplate: combo points for rogues and druids, holy power, soul shards, chi, arcane charges, essence, or runes for death knights. Classes without one show nothing.\n\nIt is on by default. Show class resource on target turns it off. Hide when empty and Glow at maximum change when and how it shows. Use class color or pick a color, and set the Empty segment color for unfilled segments. Segment width, height and spacing change the segments, and Position, distance and offsets place the row on the nameplate. Runes dim while they recharge. Soul shards fill in tenths, so a partly full shard shows as a partly filled piece."
