L["Threat colors an enemy when the wrong player has aggro. For a tank, an enemy held by another tank in your group counts as safe. Show threat on picks the health bar, its border, or both. Threat warning color and Threat safe color add a middle and a safe state, and Off-tank color marks enemies another tank holds. The game can hide threat in some fights; nameplates keep their normal color then.\n\nThreat percent shows your threat on each enemy as a number, with its own position and font."] = "Threat colors an enemy when the wrong player has aggro. For a tank, an enemy held by another tank in your group counts as safe. Show threat on picks the health bar, its border, or both. Threat warning color and Threat safe color add a middle and a safe state, and Off-tank color marks enemies another tank holds. The game can hide threat in some fights; nameplates keep their normal color then.\n\nThreat percent shows your threat on each enemy as a number, with its own position and font."
